WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to newly developed
technology, we here at

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:06.106
to record the tiny voice that is
inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.541
And you might be surprised
to know that like everyone's

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:12.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
inner voice, Donald Trump's
is filled with paralyzing fear

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:14.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
and self-doubt.
So here it is once again,

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tiny voice in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:22.822 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.057 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mr. President --

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ As Trump ] Hey, Donald.
It's the tiny voice

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the back of your head,
and oh, yeah.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:32.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
You are in
a minefield right now.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
There are so many things
that could go wrong

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:35.468 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in this situation.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.738
Who looked at this guy's outfit
and said, "We should put him

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the same room
as Donald J. Trump

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.208 line:92%
and a bunch of reporters"?

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is against every instinct
in your body,

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
to stand here, not grab
the microphone,

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:51.785
and point out everything that
is different about this person.

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:57.223
The hat, the robe, the beard --
Oh, my God.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
You wanna say something
about the beard.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.995 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You're gonna go crazy.

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:05.198 line:92%
When is this gonna be over?

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:10.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
Somebody get Dark Santa
outta here.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:10.637 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey, Donald.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in the back of your head.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:16.142
And I wanna remind you that
this is a medal ceremony,

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.545 line:92%
but that medal is not for you.

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:22.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
So whatever you do,
don't take that medal.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, but you
wanna take it so bad.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:28.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's such a good medal.
You can't stop looking at it,

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.559
thinking about how pretty it
would look around your fat neck.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
But hey, maybe someday
you'll get a medal.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what
you'd get a medal for?

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
Awkwardly swinging
your body side to side

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:43.236
while your dead arms hang limp
alongside your hulking mass.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Something that we think
is very valuable.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.572 line:92%
-[ As Trump ] Hey, Donald.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:47.674
It's the tiny voice in the back
of your head, and I'm here

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:49.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
to remind you that
you hate being President,

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:53.346
and you would give anything
right now to trade places

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:56.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
with this little kid in
his dad's lap to your right.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to pretend to listen
to this lady, and nod.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:03.189
Meanwhile, he gets to play
with his dad's big old hand.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.726 size:84% position:42%
Looks like so much fun,
rocking back and forth.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:08.661 line:92%
And you have to sit still.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:11.030
He probably gets to throw
a temper tantrum, too.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.467
When he throws a temper tantrum
it's cute, but when you do it,

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:18.037 size:78% position:39%
everyone on CNN says,
"Oh, he's a baby."

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.472 line:92%
Oh no, he's going to yawn.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you want to yawn
so bad, and oh,

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:23.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
that lucky son of
a bitch is taking a nap.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:24.477 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey, Donald.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in your head again,

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.981 size:75% position:38%
and are you thinking
what I'm thinking?

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:32.218
Because it really seems like
your wife doesn't love you.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.019 line:92%
You know why I think that?

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:37.457
Because people who are in love
do not scowl for all 24 hours

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:37.991 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
of the day.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:41.394
These people taking pictures are
gonna crack their iPhone screens

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:44.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
with how angry she looks
all the time.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, what was the last
real conversation

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:47.333 size:75% position:38% line:92%
you two had, anyway?

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because the last thing
I remember is election night,

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:54.374
when she turned to you and said,
"Are you happy now?"

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:57.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, by the way, who is
this guy talking right now?

00:02:57.343 --> 00:03:01.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
And who is this woman who
is standing next to your wife?

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:02.916 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What is going on?

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:05.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have no idea where
you are right now, do you?

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:08.021 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No idea at all.

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:08.655 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, boy.

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:09.489 line:92%
-Intellectual property rights.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:11.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ As Trump ] Hey, Donald.
It's me, the tiny voice

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:13.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the back
in your head and wow,

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.829
look at your Secretary
of Commerce, Wilbur Ross.

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:19.866
You thought you would get
to work with the coolest people

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:23.570
if you were President,
but look who is in your cabinet:

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:29.576
A very small man hovering around
the age of 112 who does not know

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:31.344 line:92%
how to lower a microphone.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:34.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
It looks like his eyeballs
are giving a speech.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:37.283
And if his eyeballs were giving
a speech I bet they'd say,

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:40.520 size:81% position:41%
"Somebody get us out
of this old-ass head."

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one is watching
this right now saying,

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:45.391
"Oh, I wish I could switch
places with Donald Trump,

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:49.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
and hang out with Wilbur Ross,
and Mike Pence."

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:51.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look what you've done
with your life.

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:53.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
You used to roll
with porn stars, and now

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:57.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're with Boresville
and Snoresville.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:01.307 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Sad.

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:01.941 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey, Donald.

00:04:01.941 --> 00:04:05.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in your head, and oh, boy.

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:07.080 size:81% position:41% line:92%
The tiny table is out.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know what
the little table means --

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:10.883 line:92%
it's time to sign your name.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:14.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
But don't do it so big
that you run out of paper.

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:15.321 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, the big D.

00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:17.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the O and the N
and the A and the --

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:18.958 line:92%
Oh, you're running out of paper.

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.293 line:92%
I hope you can fit it in.

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:22.495 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Oh, you just made it.

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:24.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, show everybody
how proud you are,

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:26.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause you signed
a piece of paper.

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:30.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the part
of the job you crush.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.638 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You're the best at this.

00:04:31.638 --> 00:04:32.572 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And now, put it away.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:35.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, let's do another one.
Let's do another one.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:39.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yep, pretend like you care
what it says.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:41.014 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Big D.

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:45.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
Little O, little N, little A.
little L, little D.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:46.052 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Big old T!

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:49.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't run out of paper.
There we go.

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:52.025 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

